   "en": "Leave inn",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:16716",
   "off": 91926,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「町から 鉱山をとったら\r  何が残るというんだ…\r  困ったもんだ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Take the mine away from this town, and what's left?... What a mess.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:16757",
   "off": 91991,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  おっと お客さんに\r  愚痴をこぼしちゃったよ」\u0010\b",
   "en": "Oops, listen to me grumbling at a customer.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:1678f",
   "off": 92047,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "何の用だい？",
   "en": "What'll it be?",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:167a3",
   "off": 92067,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「わしは 町長として\r  人々の安全に責任がある」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I'm the mayor, and the safety of these people is my burden.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:167d6",
   "off": 92118,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「よその人かね？\r  悪いが今､重要な話を\r  してるんだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"You're not from around here, eh? Sorry, but we're in the middle of something important.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:16810",
   "off": 92176,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「グリソムさんの家？\r  東の外れだと\r  思ったけど…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Grissom-san's house? I think it's out on the east edge of town...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES28:16849",
   "off": 92233,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「このまま､いつまた\r  化け物どもが出てくるか\r  わからんようでは､\u0010\b  町から逃げ出すしか\r  ない」\u0010",
   "en": "\"If we can never tell when those monsters'll come out again,\u0010\bwe'll have no choice but to flee the town.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
